<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks drop to 191,806.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks drop to 191,806.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 6 totaled 191,806 bales compared with 198,176 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 439 bales issued, 1,255 bales awaiting review, 6,809 cancellation, and 9,768 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
